{
  "dom_id": "step-6164",
  "name": "Horizontal Translations of a Parabola",
  "problem": "The graph of  ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/7816c015ff36e92e579c157d0d1e074270678c48b06f0c2d37d920311224d5e5.svg) looks like the standard parabola ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/2eb046be7e52e5a72d29a1333f9cf483411f0a8d6d897fe53014cc1952c6f759.svg), but shifted ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/6cb44f25e489afb06ec62d2e95c4d235ece77eb36e2327b856264d2fb8b22c21.svg) units to the *right* along the ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/fcc5df999e3b49fae1685ee0ab5bd03709804e1dd49f2ee722c4269eb0f5506d.svg)-axis. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/a48db73aadd4192f244676c3cb54c6849ca284acf1adbf29d6245baa5a07afcb.png)\n\nSimilarly, the graph of ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/ce16aa1f1cc35aaeae8aba5c19c0ebf1e9ea43e9624f0c6c18b42f7bfa21c304.svg) looks like the standard ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/2eb046be7e52e5a72d29a1333f9cf483411f0a8d6d897fe53014cc1952c6f759.svg) parabola after it's been shifted ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/f5f3224583db57b9cfe323c8489ef5e5271000002b5ea253eb98fd067a858b2d.svg) units to the *left*:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/9c33ae042e23cee23f96a35f31afbb3f80fb1dfece702b26c2a1aded17885861.png)\n\nIn general, the graph of ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/4b00aba256457d4efcd4f517482795d922665890adf0c2f0c0991527b5c1edfb.svg) looks like the standard parabola ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/2eb046be7e52e5a72d29a1333f9cf483411f0a8d6d897fe53014cc1952c6f759.svg) but translated ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/994427fe929fdf538d7c1be792e6fa4b85697f0921161bf5ddf0e639864c9f27.svg) units right. The vertex of ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/4b00aba256457d4efcd4f517482795d922665890adf0c2f0c0991527b5c1edfb.svg) is located at ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/efb3fb22e5e729a56d75a55b8e4b43e7ebf0cb77a3798550afdf9e05ac3a1525.svg)\n\n**Watch Out!** It's easy to confuse the translations.\n\n- For ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/7816c015ff36e92e579c157d0d1e074270678c48b06f0c2d37d920311224d5e5.svg), we subtract ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/6cb44f25e489afb06ec62d2e95c4d235ece77eb36e2327b856264d2fb8b22c21.svg) from ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/fcc5df999e3b49fae1685ee0ab5bd03709804e1dd49f2ee722c4269eb0f5506d.svg) inside the parentheses, and the parabola moves to the right, *not* to the left (even though it seems like it should be the other way around).\n\n- Likewise, for ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/ce16aa1f1cc35aaeae8aba5c19c0ebf1e9ea43e9624f0c6c18b42f7bfa21c304.svg), we add ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/f5f3224583db57b9cfe323c8489ef5e5271000002b5ea253eb98fd067a858b2d.svg) to ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218419/assets/fcc5df999e3b49fae1685ee0ab5bd03709804e1dd49f2ee722c4269eb0f5506d.svg) inside the parentheses, and the parabola moves to the left, *not* to the right.",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
